messages[10]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hey Karan uh... I got the payment link you sent but... I think I might just let the auto policy expire. Can we... cancel the renewal?
  user_2,Sure um let me check... Yeah we can let it lapse. The current policy AU‑45789 is set to expire on 01/10/2026 so if we don't process payment it will be marked expired.
  user_1,Yeah I decided to go with a different insurer I don't need the bundle anymore.
  user_2,Understood... I'll update the system to reflect a cancellation. You'll receive a confirmation email shortly.
  user_1,[sighs] Thanks. Also can you send me a copy of the final policy statement for my records even though it's expired?
  user_2,Absolutely I'll email you the policy‑summary PDF and a cancellation notice.
  user_1,Appreciate it One more thing... If I ever need to reinstate what's the process?
  user_2,You can contact us anytime we can issue a new quote. Since the policy will be marked expired you'd need a fresh application.
  user_1,Got it Thanks for your help.
  user_2,No problem Reyansh. Have a good day.